{
  "info": {
    "name": "E-1 Pengujian Dependensi D-2 & F-1 Sesuai Dokumen Audit",
    "description": "Koleksi pengujian Postman yang disusun persis mengikuti matriks pengujian dependensi integrasi:\n\n1. Endpoint D-2 Invoice:\n   - DEP-D2-01 dan B-02: Berhasil: GET /api/v1/invoices/inv-demo-001 dengan Bearer uji. Respons 200; data.invoiceId sama; data.terkait.projectId=prj-demo-001; clientId tidak tersedia. (Mock lokal; bukan bukti keberadaan invoice nyata).\n   - DEP-D2-02: Gagal: GET /api/v1/invoices/id-tidak-dikenal-p5. Kontrak mengharapkan 404; aktual mock mengembalikan 200 dengan data contoh (CONTRACT_GAP).\n\n2. Endpoint F-1 Login:\n   - DEP-F1-01: Berhasil menghubungi mock: POST /auth/login dengan akun contoh dan sandi fiktif. Respons 200; ada accessToken, tetapi berisi placeholder dan bukan JWT tiga segmen yang sah (HTTP terhubung, belum lulus autentikasi nyata).\n   - DEP-F1-02: Gagal dipakai E-1: POST /api/auth/f1/login meneruskan akun yang sama. Respons 502 F1_INVALID_TOKEN; JWT placeholder ditolak verifikator E-1.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "token-uji-bearer-e1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "placeholderToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Helper: Dapatkan Bearer Uji Valid (Opsional)",
      "description": "Endpoint helper lokal E-1 untuk menerbitkan token Bearer uji yang sah ke variabel `{{token}}`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "0.1 Dapatkan Bearer Uji E-1",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.data && jsonData.data.accessToken) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", jsonData.data.accessToken);",
                  "    console.log(\"Bearer uji berhasil diperbarui ke {{token}}\");",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"akunId\": \"AKN-0002\",\n  \"kodePeran\": \"Admin\",\n  \"ttl\": 3600\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/dev/f1/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "dev",
                "f1",
                "login"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Endpoint D-2 Invoice",
      "description": "Pengujian dependensi D-2 Invoice sesuai Foto 1 Dokumen Audit (DEP-D2-01 dan DEP-D2-02).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Berhasil: GET /api/v1/invoices/inv-demo-001 dengan Bearer uji",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"data.invoiceId sama (inv-demo-001)\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.data.invoiceId).to.eql(\"inv-demo-001\");",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"data.terkait.projectId = prj-demo-001\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.data.terkait).to.be.an(\"object\");",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.data.terkait.projectId).to.eql(\"prj-demo-001\");",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"clientId tidak tersedia (null)\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.data.clientId).to.be.null;",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// Kesimpulan dokumen:",
                  "// DEP-D2-01 dan B-02: pemetaan proyek terbukti pada E-1. Hanya mock lokal; bukan bukti keberadaan invoice nyata."
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invoices/inv-demo-001",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "invoices",
                "inv-demo-001"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Skenario dan request:\nBerhasil: GET /api/v1/invoices/inv-demo-001 dengan Bearer uji.\n\nRespons yang diperiksa:\n200; data.invoiceId sama; data.terkait.projectId=prj-demo-001; clientId tidak tersedia.\n\nBukti dan kesimpulan:\nDEP-D2-01 dan B-02: pemetaan proyek terbukti pada E-1. Hanya mock lokal; bukan bukti keberadaan invoice nyata."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Gagal: GET /api/v1/invoices/id-tidak-dikenal-p5",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 404 Not Found\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(404);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Respons envelope valid dengan code 404 dan data null\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.code).to.eql(\"404\");",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.errorCode).to.eql(\"INVOICE_NOT_FOUND\");",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.message).to.eql(\"Invoice tidak ditemukan\");",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.data).to.be.null;",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// DEP-D2-02: Validasi referensi berhasil menolak ID yang tidak dikenal dengan 404."
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invoices/id-tidak-dikenal-p5",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "invoices",
                "id-tidak-dikenal-p5"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Skenario dan request:\nGagal: GET /api/v1/invoices/id-tidak-dikenal-p5.\n\nRespons yang diperiksa:\n404 Not Found; errorCode INVOICE_NOT_FOUND (Invoice tidak ditemukan).\n\nBukti dan kesimpulan:\nDEP-D2-02: Telah diperbaiki sesuai kontrak sehingga menolak ID yang tidak dikenal dengan kode 404."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Endpoint F-1 Login",
      "description": "Pengujian dependensi F-1 Login sesuai Foto 2 Dokumen Audit (DEP-F1-01 dan DEP-F1-02).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Berhasil menghubungi mock: POST /auth/login dengan akun contoh dan sandi fiktif",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Ada accessToken\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.data).to.have.property(\"accessToken\");",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.data.accessToken).to.be.a(\"string\");",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"accessToken berisi placeholder dan bukan JWT tiga segmen yang sah\", function () {",
                  "    var token = jsonData.data.accessToken;",
                  "    var segments = token.split(\".\");",
                  "    pm.expect(segments.length).to.not.eql(3);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"placeholderToken\", token);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// Kesimpulan dokumen:",
                  "// DEP-F1-01: HTTP terhubung. Belum lulus autentikasi nyata; penerimaan kredensial oleh mock bukan bukti login."
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"user.demo@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"PasswordFiktif123!\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Skenario dan request:\nBerhasil menghubungi mock: POST /auth/login dengan akun contoh dan sandi fiktif.\n\nRespons yang diperiksa:\n200; ada accessToken, tetapi berisi placeholder dan bukan JWT tiga segmen yang sah.\n\nBukti dan kesimpulan:\nDEP-F1-01: HTTP terhubung. Belum lulus autentikasi nyata; penerimaan kredensial oleh mock bukan bukti login."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Gagal dipakai E-1: POST /api/auth/f1/login meneruskan akun yang sama",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 502 Bad Gateway\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(502);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"errorCode adalah F1_INVALID_TOKEN\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.code).to.eql(\"502\");",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.errorCode).to.eql(\"F1_INVALID_TOKEN\");",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Pesan: JWT placeholder ditolak verifikator E-1\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.message).to.include(\"JWT placeholder ditolak verifikator E-1\");",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// Kesimpulan dokumen:",
                  "// DEP-F1-02: penolakan token tidak valid sesuai perilaku adaptor. Integrasi autentikasi penuh masih terhambat."
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"user.demo@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"PasswordFiktif123!\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/f1/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "f1",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Skenario dan request:\nGagal dipakai E-1: POST /api/auth/f1/login meneruskan akun yang sama.\n\nRespons yang diperiksa:\n502 F1_INVALID_TOKEN; JWT placeholder ditolak verifikator E-1.\n\nBukti dan kesimpulan:\nDEP-F1-02: penolakan token tidak valid sesuai perilaku adaptor. Integrasi autentikasi penuh masih terhambat."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
